WEBVTT

00:00:02.035 --> 00:00:04.003
This is the Mesopotamia's computer-...

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:06.539
...the computer that you built?
That's incredible!

00:00:07.273 --> 00:00:10.174
| was only in charge of
basic theory and design.

00:00:10.243 --> 00:00:11.711
That's still incredible!

00:00:12.712 --> 00:00:15.647
It's not completed yet. We can now
control its perception, awareness...

00:00:15.715 --> 00:00:19.151
...memory, learning ability,
consciousness, and will...

00:00:19.219 --> 00:00:21.483
...but its emotional figures
are still unstable.

00:00:21.554 --> 00:00:22.919
Oh, really?

00:00:22.989 --> 00:00:25.549
Because of that, we're now
researching an operating system...

00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:28.287
...which uses my own personality
split into three parts.

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:30.352
So, if you program it
with that, this computer-...

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:32.626
...will be no different
from a human being?

00:00:32.699 --> 00:00:35.396
That's right. And after that,
man and machine can live together...

00:00:35.468 --> 00:00:37.197
...supporting one another.

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:39.637
It looks like your dream is
going to become a reality.

00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:41.174
Yes!

00:00:47.781 --> 00:00:49.340
Wh-What was that?!

00:00:49.416 --> 00:00:50.941
Ieyasu?

00:00:51.851 --> 00:00:53.250
I.I'm sorry!

00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:55.447
I-It's about time for us
to enter cold sleep...

00:00:55.522 --> 00:00:57.957
When we wake up, I'll assist
you with the debugging.

00:00:58.691 --> 00:01:00.318
Thank you, leyasu.

00:01:28.054 --> 00:01:31.285
| came to this land to protect you.

00:01:31.658 --> 00:01:34.855
| was born to be with you.

00:01:35.261 --> 00:01:38.231
The moment I awoke...

00:01:38.865 --> 00:01:42.324
...prisms surrounded me.

00:01:42.469 --> 00:01:45.769
I'm here to love you now.

00:01:46.139 --> 00:01:49.575
I was born to hold you.

00:01:49.776 --> 00:01:52.746
Lies and truths...

00:01:53.346 --> 00:01:56.907
...are all within ourselves.

00:01:57.750 --> 00:02:01.914
The days I abandon my true feelings...

00:02:01.988 --> 00:02:03.478
...won't get to me.

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:07.224
Tenderness and caring...

00:02:07.594 --> 00:02:10.564
...can be ours once again!

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:15.177
Within the eyes
of a puppet on a string.

00:02:15.201 --> 00:02:19.014
Heart shaken by a dream
that someone else contrived for me.

00:02:19.038 --> 00:02:22.418
The courage to discard
the rusted screws...

00:02:22.442 --> 00:02:27.175
...is starting to awaken inside of me.

00:02:41.761 --> 00:02:45.698
Faust: Warped Sincerity

00:03:01.147 --> 00:03:04.014
Stop this...
Don't hurt anyone else...!

00:03:05.385 --> 00:03:07.012
Please... Stop!

00:03:14.427 --> 00:03:15.394
What the heck happened?!

00:03:39.452 --> 00:03:41.045
L-Lord Faust!
What could have happened...?

00:03:42.355 --> 00:03:45.052
Just a little more...
Just one more step...!

00:03:45.725 --> 00:03:47.557
Until my love of
three centuries...

00:03:50.530 --> 00:03:53.192
Beam from above ground confirmed!
It will be a near hit!!

00:04:01.674 --> 00:04:03.142
Lord Faust"

00:04:05.011 --> 00:04:06.479
Move him, quickly"

00:04:11.050 --> 00:04:12.518
Are you all right, Lord Faust?

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:16.179
What have you returned for?

00:04:17.390 --> 00:04:18.858
Where is Tiger?

00:04:22.795 --> 00:04:24.763
Sir, Tiger...

00:04:26.399 --> 00:04:28.060
...died like a dog?

00:04:28.768 --> 00:04:32.204
Did you come here just to
report this tripe to me?

00:04:32.272 --> 00:04:34.604
Get lost. I have
nothing to say to you.

00:04:35.675 --> 00:04:37.109
Lord Faust?!

00:04:37.877 --> 00:04:40.312
Geissman! Where is Geissman?

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:41.609
Here, sir!

00:04:41.681 --> 00:04:43.274
Gather together our remaining
troops, excluding the injured...

00:04:43.349 --> 00:04:45.147
...and regroup the squadrons.
Immediately!

00:04:45.218 --> 00:04:45.980
Sir!

00:04:46.052 --> 00:04:48.111
Is that all, my Lord?

00:04:48.788 --> 00:04:50.916
Is that really all you have to say?

00:04:50.990 --> 00:04:52.389
Panther!

00:04:52.458 --> 00:04:55.393
She... She...

00:04:59.599 --> 00:05:00.896
SHE DIED FOR YOU!

00:05:00.967 --> 00:05:02.435
Panther?!?

00:05:03.336 --> 00:05:07.295
What of it? You are only
tools to me, after all.

00:05:08.741 --> 00:05:11.301
I said I have nothing
more to say to you.

00:05:14.747 --> 00:05:16.010
Panther!

00:05:16.082 --> 00:05:18.312
Lord Faust! How could you?!

00:05:18.384 --> 00:05:21.547
Get lost. Never let
me see you again.

00:05:22.622 --> 00:05:24.090
Lord Faust...?

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:44.035
You damned freak!
The castle will be ruined!

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:45.737
Orange Blossoms--Charge!!

00:06:03.996 --> 00:06:05.657
I-It's a M-MONSTER!

00:06:06.599 --> 00:06:07.725
Otaru...

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:09.234
It's TOUGH...!

00:06:19.312 --> 00:06:22.509
Damn! Are those missiles
also Gartlant weapons?!

00:06:22.749 --> 00:06:26.242
No. Calculating from their trajectory,
they are being launched from space!

00:06:26.719 --> 00:06:28.209
From SPACE?!

00:06:33.025 --> 00:06:34.493
Where's Otaru?!

00:06:36.863 --> 00:06:38.331
Otaru!!

00:06:41.401 --> 00:06:42.869
OTARUM

00:06:56.783 --> 00:06:59.616
It looks like
we're the real target.

00:06:59.685 --> 00:07:00.743
What? Why?

00:07:00.820 --> 00:07:03.653
Well, it's not really after us,
it's after our maiden circuits!

00:07:03.723 --> 00:07:05.953
WHAT?! No, you can't have them!!

00:07:08.928 --> 00:07:12.023
Otaru! Leave the monster to us!

00:07:12.098 --> 00:07:16.035
We'll keep it busy while you evacuate
the people of Japoness, Master Otaru!!

00:07:17.136 --> 00:07:18.604
Hey!

00:07:20.006 --> 00:07:21.940
Don't worry, Otaru!

00:07:22.008 --> 00:07:25.603
We'll fight really hard, so get
everyone out of Japoness, quick!!

00:07:25.678 --> 00:07:27.009
Oops!

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:28.948
W-What do you mean "quick"?

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:42.528
Shit sticks!

00:07:45.031 --> 00:07:46.499
Don't push!

00:07:59.645 --> 00:08:02.273
Okay! Wait your turn to go inside!

00:08:02.348 --> 00:08:04.510
There must be no running!
No running, understand?!

00:08:06.185 --> 00:08:08.483
Everybody WALK, without pushing!

00:08:08.554 --> 00:08:10.682
There is enough room in the
underground shelter for everyone!

00:08:10.756 --> 00:08:12.224
Do not push your neighbor!

00:08:23.035 --> 00:08:25.003
Hey, hey! We're over here!!

00:08:27.740 --> 00:08:29.265
How long do we
have to keep running?

00:08:29.342 --> 00:08:31.208
This particular game of tag
ends at the next floor!

00:08:42.722 --> 00:08:44.247
So long, sucker.

00:08:48.761 --> 00:08:50.661
And here's a souvenir.

00:08:50.730 --> 00:08:52.198
Do the honors, Cherry!

00:08:54.033 --> 00:08:56.627
Cherry, that's wild!

00:08:56.702 --> 00:08:58.761
Please rest in peace.

00:09:13.886 --> 00:09:15.320
It sure gave us a lot of trouble.

00:09:15.388 --> 00:09:17.015
What, did we get it?

00:09:19.325 --> 00:09:21.259
- WAIT!
- W-What is it?

00:11:07.633 --> 00:11:08.896
Master Otaru...

00:11:08.968 --> 00:11:10.834
Is everybody okay in there?!

00:11:11.370 --> 00:11:14.237
Lime! Cherry! Bloodberry"

00:11:15.775 --> 00:11:17.641
Master Otaru!
You mustn't come in here!!

00:11:21.414 --> 00:11:22.882
Cherry.

00:11:28.187 --> 00:11:29.279
CHERRY!

00:11:48.441 --> 00:11:49.966
Cherry...

00:11:51.777 --> 00:11:54.337
Her maiden circuit has been removed!

00:11:54.413 --> 00:11:57.280
That monster is pretty smart.

00:11:57.983 --> 00:12:01.419
80, we can't get it back
if we keep on running, huh?

00:12:01.487 --> 00:12:03.717
Come on out!
I know you're in here!

00:12:06.692 --> 00:12:08.160
Give that back!

00:12:17.169 --> 00:12:19.729
This is the Mesopotamia's computer?

00:12:20.439 --> 00:12:23.773
It's not completed yet. Its
emotional figures are still unstable.

00:12:23.843 --> 00:12:25.004
Oh...

00:12:25.077 --> 00:12:27.375
Because of that, we're now
researching an operating system...

00:12:27.446 --> 00:12:30.609
...which uses my own personality
split into three parts.

00:12:30.683 --> 00:12:32.583
So, if you complete that,
this computer-...

00:12:32.651 --> 00:12:34.745
...will be no different
from a human being?

00:12:35.054 --> 00:12:37.989
That's right. And after that,
man and machine can live together...

00:12:38.057 --> 00:12:39.752
...supporting one another.

00:12:39.825 --> 00:12:41.987
It looks like your dream is
going to become a reality.

00:12:42.061 --> 00:12:43.551
Yes!

00:12:46.031 --> 00:12:47.499
Lorelei...

00:12:48.400 --> 00:12:49.333
Shogun?

00:12:49.401 --> 00:12:52.666
Hikozaemon... I don't think
we are able to die in peace.

00:12:52.738 --> 00:12:54.399
I knew that when
signed up for the job.

00:12:56.776 --> 00:12:58.335
The monitors are back on line!

00:12:58.410 --> 00:13:01.675
There is a message coming in from
Gartlant, from Commander Goddel!

00:13:01.747 --> 00:13:03.579
Fuhrer! This is a terrible emergency!

00:13:03.649 --> 00:13:05.640
The citizens of Gartlant
have launched a coup d'etat!

00:13:05.718 --> 00:13:06.651
A WHAT?

00:13:06.719 --> 00:13:08.949
The command compound's central
computer has been obliterated...

00:13:09.021 --> 00:13:11.991
...by beam weapons and marker missiles
of unknown national origin!

00:13:12.057 --> 00:13:15.391
The resistance used the opportunity
to break out a coup d'etat!

00:13:15.461 --> 00:13:17.793
The chances of the computer being
restored any time soon are nil!

00:13:17.863 --> 00:13:19.661
The saber command system is also down!

00:13:19.732 --> 00:13:22.667
The perimeter of the compound
is being surrounded by civilians!

00:13:22.735 --> 00:13:24.635
It is only a matter of time
before they invade us!

00:13:24.703 --> 00:13:27.673
| will return after I am through here.
Until then, fend for yourself.

00:13:27.740 --> 00:13:28.935
B-But, my Lord"

00:13:29.008 --> 00:13:31.978
Hold your own! Fail to do so,
and face the firing squad!

00:13:32.144 --> 00:13:33.612
But, fuhrer!!

00:13:34.480 --> 00:13:35.948
What is Leopard doing?

00:13:36.015 --> 00:13:38.347
Sir! She has engaged the targets!

00:13:38.417 --> 00:13:40.044
She has also captured
one maiden circuit!

00:13:41.720 --> 00:13:43.279
Two to go.

00:13:53.632 --> 00:13:55.293
This thing IS tough.

00:13:59.839 --> 00:14:00.965
Hey, Lime.

00:14:02.041 --> 00:14:03.167
You scared?

00:14:03.242 --> 00:14:05.233
Yeah. But I won't let it beat me!

00:14:05.744 --> 00:14:08.975
I have to beat it, and get
Cherry's maiden circuit back!

00:14:12.818 --> 00:14:14.286
Lime!

00:14:16.622 --> 00:14:18.590
Bloodberry?!
What was that for?!

00:14:19.525 --> 00:14:21.459
Take care of Otaru, okay?

00:14:22.761 --> 00:14:24.229
BLOODBERRY!

00:14:25.798 --> 00:14:27.766
Bloodberry?! Bloodberry!!

00:14:28.667 --> 00:14:32.695
Bloodberry, that's not fair!
We've always done everything together!

00:14:32.771 --> 00:14:34.239
Bloodberry!!

00:14:36.709 --> 00:14:37.733
LET'S GET BUSY!

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:39.278
Bloodberry?!?

00:14:41.714 --> 00:14:43.239
What was that explosion?!

00:14:52.424 --> 00:14:53.892
Bloodberry...!

00:14:57.062 --> 00:14:58.393
Bloodberry...

00:15:03.736 --> 00:15:05.329
One to go!

00:15:08.107 --> 00:15:10.735
Cherry, Bloodberry... I'm coming!

00:15:10.809 --> 00:15:12.277
I'll get them back!

00:15:27.393 --> 00:15:29.225
I can't lose...
| won't lose...!

00:15:29.662 --> 00:15:31.289
| REFUSE TO LOSE"!

00:15:32.031 --> 00:15:34.466
Did we ever make a face
like that when we fought?

00:15:36.702 --> 00:15:38.636
She would always
say the same thing...

00:15:38.704 --> 00:15:40.672
"I'll protect Otaru.”

00:15:40.739 --> 00:15:42.867
But we would protect Lord Faust
as well, given the chance!

00:15:42.942 --> 00:15:45.377
That's right, we would.
How are we different, then?

00:15:45.444 --> 00:15:47.344
We all have the same
maiden circuits...

00:15:47.980 --> 00:15:50.210
...so why can't we
make the same face as her?!

00:15:52.584 --> 00:15:55.747
Is it because we are
nothing but tools to him?!

00:15:56.055 --> 00:15:57.989
If so, I don't want this thing!

00:15:58.057 --> 00:15:59.957
Panther, let's stop this.

00:16:00.025 --> 00:16:02.653
If the maiden circuit only
gives us this kind of torture...

00:16:02.728 --> 00:16:04.196
Panther...?!

00:16:05.731 --> 00:16:07.961
But...
It still doesn't matter...

00:16:08.367 --> 00:16:11.462
I still love Lord Faust!!
I love him hopelessly!

00:16:12.771 --> 00:16:14.398
You're not the only one...!

00:16:31.724 --> 00:16:34.921
I.. I have to save
Cherry and Bloodberry.."

00:16:34.994 --> 00:16:36.985
We all have to stay together!

00:16:40.699 --> 00:16:43.327
Get your dirty mitts...
...OFF OF HER"!

00:16:45.404 --> 00:16:47.338
Are you okay, Lime?
Hang on!

00:16:49.375 --> 00:16:50.968
Let go!
Let go of me!!

00:16:51.977 --> 00:16:53.445
Otaru...!

00:16:57.983 --> 00:16:59.451
OTARUM

00:17:01.720 --> 00:17:03.210
DON'T PICK ON OTARU!!

00:17:07.693 --> 00:17:09.320
Otaru! Otaru!!

00:17:09.395 --> 00:17:12.660
I'm supposed to be rescuing,
not the one being rescued!

00:17:12.731 --> 00:17:14.961
It's all right. I'll protect you!

00:17:15.034 --> 00:17:16.297
Lime...

00:17:16.368 --> 00:17:20.100
That's right, I'll protect you!
Because I love you!

00:17:21.173 --> 00:17:22.641
Lime...

00:17:24.877 --> 00:17:27.244
What's this?
My maiden circuit feels so hot...

00:17:28.380 --> 00:17:29.848
| can feel strength
pour into me!

00:17:34.319 --> 00:17:36.811
Otaru, give them back
their maiden circuits!

00:17:37.356 --> 00:17:38.448
Roger that"

00:17:38.791 --> 00:17:42.193
Leopard! Why can't you defeat
that little insect?!

00:17:42.761 --> 00:17:45.287
Lord Faust! We can't hold
them back any longer!

00:17:45.364 --> 00:17:47.264
They have the compound
completely surrounded!

00:17:50.335 --> 00:17:51.928
If something isn't done soon...

00:17:52.004 --> 00:17:54.029
Lord Faust! Permission to evacuate!

00:17:56.008 --> 00:17:57.032
It's over.

00:18:07.753 --> 00:18:08.686
Huh?

00:18:08.754 --> 00:18:10.222
I'm sorry I took so long!

00:18:10.289 --> 00:18:11.381
Cherry!

00:18:11.457 --> 00:18:13.221
- Sorry I'm late!
- Bloodberry!!

00:18:30.609 --> 00:18:32.873
Now Cherry and Bloodberry
are putting out the same speed!

00:18:32.945 --> 00:18:35.277
Their maiden circuits are
resonating with each other...!

00:18:35.714 --> 00:18:37.876
They're amazing!
They're freakin' amazing!

00:18:38.484 --> 00:18:42.284
Their maiden circuits have
reached their peak growth.

00:18:42.354 --> 00:18:42.786
What?

00:18:56.635 --> 00:18:57.966
Lime!!!

00:18:58.270 --> 00:19:00.466
Cherry! Bloodberry!!

00:19:00.539 --> 00:19:01.973
Otarul

00:19:03.075 --> 00:19:04.338
Impossible...

00:19:04.409 --> 00:19:05.843
We just received a wire
from Gartlant!

00:19:05.911 --> 00:19:07.902
The command compound
has fallen!!

00:19:07.980 --> 00:19:09.914
Commander Goddel has
been taken prisoner?!!

00:19:10.749 --> 00:19:12.239
Dr. Hess has gone missing!

00:19:12.751 --> 00:19:16.312
The day of "Lord Faust”
was quite entertaining.

00:19:16.388 --> 00:19:19.289
I only hope that the next generation
will be just as entertaining.

00:19:21.460 --> 00:19:23.952
You guys were amazing!
That was unreal!

00:19:24.396 --> 00:19:26.660
You know, the more and more
| thought about you...

00:19:26.732 --> 00:19:29.978
.| started getting warmer and warmer,
and then, I got really, really strong!!

00:19:30.002 --> 00:19:31.163
0-Oh, really?

00:19:31.236 --> 00:19:32.635
OTARU!

00:19:32.704 --> 00:19:34.229
I've been looking all over for you!!
Ooh, that's so CRUEL"

00:19:34.306 --> 00:19:37.298
I bet you forgot all about me!
I bet you did, I bet you did"

00:19:37.376 --> 00:19:39.504
I couldn't forget you,
even if I wanted to.

00:19:40.345 --> 00:19:43.406
This is impossible!
It's taken me 300 years...

00:19:43.715 --> 00:19:47.015
I've endured 300 years
of rebirth for this day!

00:19:47.686 --> 00:19:48.812
This is an outrage!

00:19:48.887 --> 00:19:51.288
I can't have lost to measly
maiden circuits... To hearts!

00:19:52.024 --> 00:19:54.118
The maiden circuits are mere tools!

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:57.759
What has my 300 years all been for?!

00:19:58.697 --> 00:20:00.165
Lord Faust!

00:20:00.832 --> 00:20:03.267
Luchs! Panther!
You lead the vanguard!

00:20:03.335 --> 00:20:06.930
If I must go down,
they must all go down with me!

00:20:08.307 --> 00:20:09.934
What?! Get going!!

00:20:10.008 --> 00:20:12.340
- Lord Faust...
- Please stop this.

00:20:12.411 --> 00:20:15.608
You pathetic little...
| gave you an order

00:20:15.681 --> 00:20:17.149
| cannot comply.

00:20:18.717 --> 00:20:20.344
Then, die.

00:20:21.153 --> 00:20:23.315
To die at your hands...

00:20:23.388 --> 00:20:25.356
...would be a great honor, sir.

00:20:26.058 --> 00:20:27.787
Then, I'll kill you,
just as you wish!

00:20:29.094 --> 00:20:30.584
Lord Faust...

00:20:30.662 --> 00:20:32.130
...thank you.

00:20:32.698 --> 00:20:36.134
How can you smile like that?!
Aren't you at all AFRAID?!

00:20:36.668 --> 00:20:39.103
It would be far more frightening
to go on living in a world...

00:20:39.171 --> 00:20:42.573
...where you don't exist. Our hearts
would be crushed beyond repair.

00:20:42.641 --> 00:20:46.874
If you died, there would be
no meaning to our lives.

00:20:47.980 --> 00:20:51.075
Now, please... If you plan to continue
this fight, please kill us first.

00:21:02.661 --> 00:21:03.924
ENOUGH OF THIS!

00:21:03.996 --> 00:21:06.192
This is no time to be
fighting amongst ourselves!

00:21:06.265 --> 00:21:10.327
Those beams and missiles landed
on your country too, didn't they?!

00:21:10.402 --> 00:21:12.427
This isn't the time for
this sort of nonsense!!

00:21:19.344 --> 00:21:20.368
Lord Faust...!

00:21:23.682 --> 00:21:24.706
Stop it...

00:21:24.783 --> 00:21:27.377
Don't hurt any more of
the people of Terra ll...!

00:21:32.691 --> 00:21:35.388
Please!!
| promise I won't leave!!

00:21:35.460 --> 00:21:36.928
PLEASE...!

00:21:38.096 --> 00:21:39.791
| can hear the lady
from the picture...

00:21:39.865 --> 00:21:42.357
In the sky! The lady
from the picture is crying!

00:21:42.734 --> 00:21:44.600
THE SKY?! The sky,
as in OUTER SPACE?!

00:21:50.776 --> 00:21:52.244
A missile is approaching!

00:21:54.780 --> 00:21:56.270
It's aimed directly at us!

00:21:56.348 --> 00:21:57.941
Everyone must RUN!

00:21:58.016 --> 00:21:59.108
RUN?! W-W-W-Where to?!

00:21:59.184 --> 00:22:00.652
Just RUN!

00:22:01.053 --> 00:22:03.750
Faust! What are you DOING?!
Get moving!

00:22:03.822 --> 00:22:05.381
Faust"

00:22:31.283 --> 00:22:34.981
When you're sad, when you're blue...

00:22:35.053 --> 00:22:38.751
...don't go off to be alone.

00:22:38.890 --> 00:22:41.723
Just think of me...

00:22:41.793 --> 00:22:46.424
...and I'll be there with you.

00:22:46.665 --> 00:22:50.397
Strength is a very important thing...

00:22:50.469 --> 00:22:54.167
...but tears are important, too.

00:22:54.339 --> 00:22:58.086
You can't do anything at all...

00:22:58.110 --> 00:22:59.887
...with a dried-up heart.

00:22:59.911 --> 00:23:03.905
You can't feel a thing.

00:23:06.017 --> 00:23:08.315
Tell me, why do people hide...

00:23:08.387 --> 00:23:13.382
...what they really feel inside?

00:23:13.592 --> 00:23:17.187
Take what you can do,
what you want to do...

00:23:17.396 --> 00:23:21.026
...one step at a time.

00:23:21.266 --> 00:23:24.827
I love the way you don't care...

00:23:24.903 --> 00:23:28.737
...how you have been
programmed to live.

00:23:28.907 --> 00:23:32.434
| would follow you anywhere.

00:23:32.778 --> 00:23:39.241
I'll never, ever let you go.

00:23:48.293 --> 00:23:49.192
Damn it all!

00:23:49.261 --> 00:23:51.855
At this rate, Terralll
will be destroyed!

00:23:51.930 --> 00:23:54.900
What...? Lorelei is
on the Mesopotamia?!

00:23:54.966 --> 00:23:57.560
The maiden circuits were made
with a definite mission?

00:23:57.636 --> 00:24:01.231
You need them to die
for the good of Terra II?!

00:24:01.306 --> 00:24:04.037
Go to Hell!
We're sticking together!

00:24:04.109 --> 00:24:07.306
To me... You're real...
Real, honest-to-gosh...!

00:24:08.213 --> 00:24:11.706
The Maidens' Voyage
Next on Saber Marionette J!

00:24:11.917 --> 00:24:13.885
NO, LIME! DON'T GO
